# Cursor Rules — AI 协作协议

## 启动
- `cat STATUS.md` — 项目全景（自动生成，勿手改）
- `bash scripts/session/ses-context-load.sh`
- 阅读 `docs/ai/constraints/index.md`
- 任务以 `.ai/tasks.json` 为准；**无 ready AC 不开工**（`docs/guides/GC-task-acceptance.md`）

## 决策流转

```
NOTE → DEC → lifecycle → wf-promote.sh → golden → gov-validate.sh → commit
```

- 创建 DEC: `bash scripts/governance/gov-next-decision.sh --create`
- 黄金标准不可直改；须 lifecycle → promote

## 文件规范

| 目录 | 格式 |
|------|------|
| `docs/guides/` | `GC-{slug}.md` |
| `docs/reference/` | `REF-{slug}.md` |
| `docs/notes/` | `NOTE-YYYYMMDD-NNN.md` |
| `docs/ai/decisions/` | `DEC-XXX.md` |

**严禁:** old/legacy/vN 路径，bak/backup/copy 后缀

## 校验与合入

```bash
bash scripts/governance/gov-validate.sh
bash scripts/governance/gov-local-ci.sh
```

- pre-commit = `gov-pre-commit-simplified`（compile + custom-checks）；DEC-047
- 合入：local-ci 全绿 + `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md` 勾选（无 Pro 时的纪律门禁）；DEC-048
- 编码约定：`docs/guides/GC-coding-conventions.md`

## 工程反思（自愿）

强制反思已拆除。有教训时追加 `docs/guides/GC-engineering-reflections.md`。

